        "richtext_6PmiQf": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_class_name": "richtext-p-section",
            "content": "<h6>At Center for Balanced Living, we offer therapy, psychological evaluations, consultation, supervision, and educational services grounded in clinical expertise, trauma-informed care, and respect for the whole person. </h6><h6>Our services are designed to meet clients, families, and professionals at different points in the healing and growth process, whether you are seeking emotional support, diagnostic clarity, family guidance, or continued professional development.</h6><h6>We understand that reaching out for care can feel overwhelming, especially when you are not sure where to begin. Our goal is to help you identify the service that best fits your needs and to provide care that is thoughtful, research-based, and responsive to your lived experience.</h6><h6>Whether you are beginning therapy, pursuing an evaluation, or looking for training and consultation, our work begins with careful listening, clinical clarity, and a collaborative path forward.</h6>"
